  "description": "AvatarView for Spine: animated characters and ambient visuals from .spineavatar files, drawn with SkiaSharp (vector scenes and SkSL shaders) and SceneKit (glTF on iOS and Mac Catalyst), driven by the app's state, by text, by speech or by a realtime voice conversation, with Reduce Motion, the app's theme and one screen-reader element. Built-in bars and ring show a voice's sound in and out.",
